<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>中国支持的巴基斯坦交易所准备推出股票期权</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options</link><description>巴基斯坦证券交易所计划明年推出股票期权，为投资者提供另一种工具，让他们押注过去三年增长了两倍的市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options'&gt;中国支持的巴基斯坦交易所准备推出股票期权&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China-Backed Pakistan Exchange Prepares to Launch Stock Options&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:00:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks, Nasdaq Futures Climb as AI Trade Rebounds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚企业预计未来 12 个月通胀率将保持在 4% 以上</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-firms-see-inflation-holding-over-4-for-next-12-months</link><description>澳大利亚企业预计，即使政策制定者今年加息五次以试图控制消费者价格，未来 12 个月通胀仍将远高于储备银行 2-3% 目标区间的上限。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-firms-see-inflation-holding-over-4-for-next-12-months'&gt;澳大利亚企业预计未来 12 个月通胀率将保持在 4% 以上&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Firms See Inflation Holding Over 4% for Next 12 Months&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-firms-see-inflation-holding-over-4-for-next-12-months</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国关税提案加大了印度达成贸易协议的风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-tariff-proposal-raises-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal</link><description>美国周三宣布的关税税率给印度带来了压力，要求其同意贸易协议，否则将面临更高的征税，这使得出口商和投资者对贸易前景不太清楚。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-tariff-proposal-raises-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal'&gt;美国关税提案加大了印度达成贸易协议的风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Tariff Plan Raises Stakes for India to Clinch Trade Deal&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-tariff-proposal-raises-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:03:17 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>